<title>USA: Harmony Brook Inc Q4 net loss narrows.</title>
<headline>Harmony Brook Inc Q4 net loss narrows.</headline>
<dateline>ST. PAUL, Minn. 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fourth Quarter Ended December 31</p>
<p>							1996	    1995</p>
<p> Total revenues			    $2,039,000    $1,772,000</p>
<p> Gross Profit				 1,067,000	 964,000</p>
<p> Operating loss				(49,000)	(99,000)</p>
<p> Net loss				     (200,000)     (277,000)</p>
<p> Net loss per share			   ( 0.02)	 ( 0.04)</p>
<p> Number of shares			   8,045,000     6,786,000</p>
<p>					Twelve Months Ended December 31</p>
<p>							1996	    1995</p>
<p> Total revenues			    $8,316,000    $7,175,000</p>
<p> Gross Profit				 4,433,000     3,758,000</p>
<p> Operating income (loss)*		   150,000     (734,000)</p>
<p> Net loss*				    (481,000)   (1,400,000)</p>
<p> Net loss per share*			  ( 0.06)	 ( 0.26)</p>
<p> Number of shares			   7,982,000     5,377,000</p>
<p>* 1995 includes charges of $316,000, or $0.06 per share, related to the write-off of a questionable account receivable, severance and other special items.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
